{"op": "upsert_entity", "payload": {"attrs": {"field": "scope", "layer": "county", "provenance": "dataset", "quote": "Active as of 2026-09-23. 120-day moratorium on the acceptance/issuance of new data center permits in unincorporated Pima County, adopted 3-2 (Supervisors Christy and Scott dissenting) on 2026-08-11 and running to approximately 2026-12-09, while Development Services finalizes a zoning code text amendment. The department is seeking public comment (online survey; a September 28, 2026 open house; proposed rules going to the Planning and Zoning Commission on October 28, 2026) on a related, permanent zoning code amendment that would define data centers (facilities using more than 20 MW), require closed-loop cooling, and set review/design standards; that permanent amendment is expected in December 2026, around when the moratorium runs out.", "rule": "az-pima-county-2026", "text": "scope = unincorporated", "value": "unincorporated", "verification": "dataset"}, "id": "claim:rule-az-pima-county-2026-02ac2a379dea-so-2196cb816b86", "name": "rule:az-pima-county-2026-02ac2a379dea|source_document:moratorium-nation-dataset-refreshed-2026-d0cb2881dcb4|Active as of 2026-09-23. 120-day moratorium on the acceptance/issuance of new data center permits in unincorporated Pima County, adopted 3-2 (Supervisors Christy and Scott dissenting) on 2026-08-11 and running to approximately 2026-12-09, while Development Services finalizes a zoning code text amendment. The department is seeking public comment (online survey; a September 28, 2026 open house; proposed rules going to the Planning and Zoning Commission on October 28, 2026) on a related, permanent zoning code amendment that would define data centers (facilities using more than 20 MW), require closed-loop cooling, and set review/design standards; that permanent amendment is expected in December 2026, around when the moratorium runs out.|scope = unincorporated", "type": "claim"}, "seq": 10, "source": {"at": "2026-10-25T15:38:46.460260+00:00", "kind": "agent", "model": null, "role": "system", "round": 0}}
